@HealthCareSystem_HostAddress = http://localhost:5186

### Retrieve all appointments
GET {{HealthCareSystem_HostAddress}}/api/Appointment/GetAll
Accept: application/json

### Create a new appointment
POST {{HealthCareSystem_HostAddress}}/api/Appointment/Post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "987e6543-e21b-34d3-c456-426614174111",
